---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="School Break Care - Marietta Childcare"
  description="Discover Marietta Childcare's School Break Care program with holiday and spring break programs, special activities, and flexible scheduling.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/music_time_tambourine_motion_background.jpg" 
        alt="School break activities" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">School Break Care</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Holiday and spring break programs with special activities, enrichment, and flexible scheduling for school closures.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's School Break Care program provides holiday and spring break programs with special activities and flexible scheduling. The School Break Care program at Marietta Childcare offers full-day care during school closures with engaging activities and enrichment opportunities.
        </p>

        <h2>Holiday Programs</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's School Break Care includes special holiday programs during winter break and other school holidays. The School Break Care program features themed activities, celebrations, and festive experiences.
        </p>

        <h2>Spring Break Programs</h2>
        <p>
          The School Break Care program at Marietta Childcare offers full-day spring break care with special activities and field trips. Marietta Childcare's spring break programs provide engaging experiences and educational enrichment.
        </p>

        <h2>Special Activities</h2>
        <p>
          Marietta Childcare's School Break Care includes special activities such as arts and crafts, STEM projects, outdoor adventures, and community field trips. The School Break Care program keeps children engaged and entertained during school closures.
        </p>

        <h2>Flexible Scheduling</h2>
        <p>
          The School Break Care program at Marietta Childcare offers flexible enrollment options for families who need care during specific break periods. Marietta Childcare accommodates various scheduling needs during school breaks.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
        <div class="bg-primary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Break Programs</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Winter break care</li>
            <li>✓ Spring break programs</li>
            <li>✓ Holiday celebrations</li>
            <li>✓ Special activities</li>
            <li>✓ Field trips</li>
            <li>✓ Themed weeks</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-secondary/5 p-6 rounded-lg">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">Enrollment Options</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
            <li>✓ Full-week enrollment</li>
            <li>✓ Daily drop-in care</li>
            <li>✓ Flexible scheduling</li>
            <li>✓ Ages K-5th grade</li>
            <li>✓ Nutritious meals</li>
            <li>✓ Safe supervision</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-secondary/10 p-8 rounded-lg mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Reliable Care During School Breaks</h2>
        <p class="mb-6">Marietta Childcare's School Break Care program provides reliable, quality care when school is closed. The School Break Care program offers peace of mind for working parents with engaging activities and safe supervision.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-primary text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full font-bold hover:scale-105 transition-transform">
          Enroll in School Break Care
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Related Programs</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <a href="/programs/after-school" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">After-School Program →</a>
          <a href="/programs/summer-camp" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Summer Camp Program →</a>
          <a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Solutions for Working Parents →</a>
          <a href="/faq/hours-and-schedule" class="text-primary font-bold hover:underline">Hours and Schedule →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
